    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Coastal 4-Bedroom Residence on Approx. 2.5 Acres Overlooking Beldarra Beach\r\n\r\nTim Quinn & Co. Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this exceptional four-bedroom residence, set on approximately 2.5 acres in a spectacular coastal location overlooking Beldarra Beach, Belmullet, Co. Mayo.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in one of the most beautiful coastal settings in the Belmullet area. The property is set back from the road, offering peace, privacy and a wonderful sense of seclusion, while Beldarra Beach is just a five-minute walk from the house. The sound of the Atlantic waves can be heard from the property, creating a truly special coastal atmosphere."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation comprises four bedrooms, one of which is ensuite, together with a large main bathroom. The property also features a generous kitchen and dining area, ideal for family living and entertaining, along with a cosy living room featuring an open fire — perfect for relaxing after a day outdoors."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The house is heated by oil-fired central heating, with open fireplaces in the living and dining areas.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property sits on approximately 2.5 acres, providing excellent space for gardens, recreation, keeping animals or other appropriate uses. The additional land to the rear of the house offers further potential and could be utilised in a variety of ways, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\r\n\r\nThere is also a partially converted attic space, which offers exciting potential for additional accommodation, subject to planning and building regulations. This could provide the opportunity to create further bedrooms, office space, a studio or additional living accommodation."
      }
    ],
